OL,3,GNEWSA'Iconic' motorbike returns home
OL,4,Aafter 100 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 103-year-old handmade motorcycle has
OL,7,Freturned home to the village where it
OL,8,Fwas made.
OL,10,FThe Grindley Sporting bike was built by
OL,11,FBilly Grindley at his garage in Prees,
OL,12,FShropshire, in 1923 and since then has
OL,13,Fchanged owners several times,
OL,14,Feventually being bought by the National
OL,15,FMotorcycle Museum in Solihull.
OL,17,FIt has now been allowed out on loan and
OL,18,Fwill be exhibited in the Grocott
OL,19,FHeritage Centre in Station Road during
OL,20,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
