OL,3,GNEWSA'Iconic' motorbike returns home
OL,4,Aafter 100 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal motorcycle enthusiast Harry
OL,7,FCopnall helped bring the bike to the
OL,8,Fvillage and said: "It's a wonderful
OL,9,Fopportunity for the people of Prees to
OL,10,Fhave a look what was produced or
OL,11,Fmanufactured in Prees in those days."
